.TH MLH-SETTINGS-GTK 1 "November 2026" "mlh" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mlh-settings-gtk \- open the mlh graphical settings window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mlh-settings-gtk
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens a GTK 4 window for editing mlh settings on Linux and Wayland.
Settings supplied by environment variables are shown read-only because
the environment takes precedence over saved values.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mlh-settings-tui (1),
.BR mlh-settings-backend (1)
